        itemId = 27445,
        name = "Magical Crawdad",
        stepCount = 7,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Fish up the rare Mr. Pinchy and use his limited wishes; the desired pet is not guaranteed.\n\n1. Learn Fishing and Outland Fishing before starting. Juno Dufrain at 78.0, 66.0 in Cenarion Refuge, Zangarmarsh, is an Outland fishing trainer. Bring a character able to fly to Terokkar's high lakes; the old 375/525-skill and fishing-tournament-gear instructions are unnecessary for pool fishing in Retail.\n\n2. Fly to Lake Jorune, above Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest, around 46.3, 39.6. Look specifically for Highland Mixed Schools. Position your cast so the bobber lands inside the visible school, catch and loot, then continue until that pool disappears.\n\n3. When that lake has no schools, check Lake Ere'Noru above Allerian Stronghold around 60.3, 59.2, then Blackwind Lake at Skettis around 66.4, 80.0. Circle the shore and fish the Highland Mixed Schools. Rotate among the three lakes rather than casting into empty open water.\n\n4. Keep fishing and fully loot each catch until you obtain Mr. Pinchy (27388). Ordinary Furious Crawdad is cooking fish, not the pet item. Mr. Pinchy is rare, so another player's low cast count does not establish a guaranteed number of catches.\n\n5. With a free bag slot, right-click Mr. Pinchy to spend a wish. It has three charges. A wish can create Magical Crawdad Box, a buff, a temporary friendly or hostile creature, or another gift. You do not need to talk to a summoned creature to choose the pet.\n\n6. If the first wish does not give Magical Crawdad Box, keep Mr. Pinchy and wait FOUR HOURS before the next use. Use the remaining charges as they become ready. Copies carried by the same character share the cooldown. If all three fail, fish another Mr. Pinchy and continue.\n\n7. When Magical Crawdad Box appears in your bags, use it to learn Magical Crawdad and check the Pet Journal. The species can also be bought as a caged pet from another player if you prefer to skip fishing.",
        faction = "all",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=27445",
        difficultyReason = "Fish up the rare Mr. Pinchy and use his limited wishes; the desired pet is not guaranteed.",
        difficulty = "hard",
    },
