        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Complete Skywing's short escort quest for a guaranteed pet reward.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests on your minimap tracking menu, then go to Veil Shalas in southern Terokkar Forest. Find Skywing, the large white bird, near 53.8, 72.2 at the base of the tree settlement. He patrols, so search the nearby ground if the exact point is empty.\n\n2. Accept Skywing (10898) from the bird and stay close as he enters the tree and climbs the ramps. Put a raid marker on him if it helps you track him. If another player has already started the escort, wait for Skywing to return to the starting area.\n\n3. Follow him across the raised platforms and bridges, killing enemies he pulls. He can pause near the first tree for about a minute; allow the escort to continue before abandoning it. At the platform drop, follow him onto the lower platform rather than taking the long ground route away from him.\n\n4. Near 55.6, 69.6, help Skywing fight Luanga the Imprisoner. Keep your back toward the central structure so a knockback cannot throw you from the platform. Stay until Skywing's transformation finishes and your quest log records completion.\n\n5. Return to Rilak the Redeemed at 52.6, 20.8 in Shattrath City's Lower City and turn in Skywing. Miniwing is the pet reward; collect it from the quest turn-in and use the item from your bags to learn the species.",
        faction = "all",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=31760",
        difficultyReason = "Complete Skywing's short escort quest for a guaranteed pet reward.",
        difficulty = "easy",
